Package: SPADES.IND
Type: Package
Title: Energy-Driven Privacy-Aware Synthetic Microdata Research Toolkit
Version: 0.1.8
Authors@R: person("Pierpaolo", "Massoli", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "pimassol@istat.it")
Description: Bayesian-network proposals and energy-driven adaptive sampling
    generate a candidate pool with plausibility, distance-based privacy and
    diversity penalties. Incremental simulated annealing selects a target using
    marginal, pairwise and conditional fidelity with optional classification or
    regression utility. Includes preparation, numeric reconstruction and tests.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, utils, methods, tools, graphics, grDevices, Rcpp, parallel, withr (>= 2.5.0),
    rngtools
Suggests: rpart, xgboost, Matrix, doParallel, foreach, ranger, bnlearn,
    data.table, ggplot2, keras, tensorflow, codetools, knitr, rmarkdown
LinkingTo: Rcpp
SystemRequirements: C++11
VignetteBuilder: knitr
